Package: barbac
Type: Package
Title: End-to-end DNA barcode lineage analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-07-01
Authors@R: person("Loukas", "Theodosiou", role = c("aut", "cre"), email
        = "theodosiou@evolbio.mpg.de")
Description: barbac provides an end-to-end workflow for DNA barcode
        lineage analysis, from raw FASTQ reads through error-corrected
        centroid clusters. The core clustering routine super_cluster2()
        implements abundance-ranked greedy Levenshtein clustering with
        a distance-aware count-ratio merge guard, backed by a
        bit-parallel 64-bit edit-distance kernel written in C++.
